      <h1 class="jr-h1">Osteopenia vs Osteoporosis: How to Read Your DEXA Report</h1>
      <p class="jr-standfirst">People bring their DEXA report to clinic convinced osteopenia means they are halfway to a fracture, or convinced it means nothing at all. Neither is right. Here is how to read the numbers, which ones actually decide treatment, and the Indian catch most reports do not mention.</p>

